      <h1>Page not found</h1>
      <p>Choose your language to return to the George Town heritage guide.</p>
      <p lang="ms-MY">Halaman tidak ditemui. Kembali ke panduan warisan George Town.</p>
      <p lang="zh-Hans">找不到该页面。请选择语言，返回乔治市遗产指南。</p>
      <nav aria-label="Language"><a href="/">Bahasa Melayu</a> · <a href="/en/">English</a> · <a href="/zh/">中文</a></nav>
